{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Maze In Your Mind",
    "steam_appid": 3808180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't play any game until your mind plays it first</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't solve any maze until your mind solves it first</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze In Your Mind\u00a0is a game about a three-layer maze connected by static portals where the player must find the right portal to unlock the final portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right portal is signaled by visual cues and audio rhythms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies and explore the maze, but not the maze you see, but the maze you don't see, the maze in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one mind is not enough then play in BattleMind mode where you can play together with another mind\u00a0in the same device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 levels (minds) in single-player mode with 3 mazes each connected by static portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level (mind) in single-player mode has between 2 and 7 short repeating musical rhythms as audio signals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels (minds) in BattleMind (multi-player) mode\u00a0with 3 mazes each connected by static portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against the computer, against your friend, team up with your friend against the computer or free for all in BattleMind mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a 7-second game in the lose box or win box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration mode - freely roam the vast maze and discover hard-to-reach places, as well as capture some ideas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808180/extras/42ead155dbc75d63d9c9ec3abf01ddac.avif?t=1755328568\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want to see your physical self, look in the mirror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want to see your non-physical self, look at the boundary (wall).</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't play any game until your mind plays it first</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't solve any maze until your mind solves it first</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze In Your Mind\u00a0is a game about a three-layer maze connected by static portals where the player must find the right portal to unlock the final portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right portal is signaled by visual cues and audio rhythms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies and explore the maze, but not the maze you see, but the maze you don't see, the maze in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one mind is not enough then play in BattleMind mode where you can play together with another mind\u00a0in the same device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 levels (minds) in single-player mode with 3 mazes each connected by static portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level (mind) in single-player mode has between 2 and 7 short repeating musical rhythms as audio signals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels (minds) in BattleMind (multi-player) mode\u00a0with 3 mazes each connected by static portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against the computer, against your friend, team up with your friend against the computer or free for all in BattleMind mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a 7-second game in the lose box or win box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration mode - freely roam the vast maze and discover hard-to-reach places, as well as capture some ideas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808180/extras/42ead155dbc75d63d9c9ec3abf01ddac.avif?t=1755328568\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want to see your physical self, look in the mirror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want to see your non-physical self, look at the boundary (wall).</strong></p>",
